417 true] [17592186436932 1079 #uuid "cbf3222d-f787-5312-b008-17567e5ae0c6" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436933 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436931 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436933 1069 "q-105557" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436933 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436933 1071 "Consider the vector field $F=xyz\\,i+{y}^{3}{x}^{2}\\,j+y{z}^{2}\\,k.$ \nFind $\\text{div}\\,F.$" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436933 1072 #uuid "22c40f40-e4e5-529d-a83f-3f46f140c8db" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436933 1074 "If $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j+R\\,k$ is a vector field on ${R}^{3}$ and the partial derivatives of the components of $F$ all exist, then the divergence of $F$ is the scalar field given by\n\n$$\n\\text{div}\\,F=∇\\cdot F=\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}+\\frac{∂R}{∂z}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{div}F & =\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}+\\frac{∂R}{∂z} \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(xyz)+\\frac{∂}{∂y}({y}^{3}{x}^{2})+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(y{z}^{2}) \\\\  & =yz+3{y}^{2}{x}^{2}+2yz \\\\  & =3yz+3{y}^{2}{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436934 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436932 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436934 1069 "q-131175" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436934 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436934 1071 "Consider the vector field $F={e}^{2x}\\,i-y{e}^{2x}\\,j-z{e}^{2x}\\,k.$ \nFind $∇\\cdot F.$" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436934 1072 #uuid "36837fe3-6724-5929-9249-1bb3cf0a5e7f" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436934 1074 "If $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j+R\\,k$ is a vector field on ${R}^{3}$ and the partial derivatives of the components of $F$ all exist, then the divergence of $F$ is the scalar field given by\n\n$$\n∇\\cdot F=\\text{div}\\,F=\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}+\\frac{∂R}{∂z}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\cdot F & =\\frac{∂P}{∂x}+\\frac{∂Q}{∂y}+\\frac{∂R}{∂z} \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({e}^{2x})+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(-y{e}^{2x})+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(-z{e}^{2x}) \\\\  & =2{e}^{2x}-{e}^{2x}-{e}^{2x} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436935 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436939 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436935 1062 #uuid "0c687dc8-83c3-51c4-b6a7-2402b933a9ce" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436935 1063 #edb/ref 17592186424227 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436936 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436938 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436936 1062 #uuid "0eb2dca7-e256-5a91-aeab-a6e0be87d07f" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436936 1063 #edb/ref 17592186241080 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436937 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436936 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436937 1062 #uuid "6a7d78a0-8d6d-590f-8d8a-84c35fdbd7e4" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436937 1063 #edb/ref 17592186436933 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436938 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436935 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436938 1062 #uuid "af33c61a-5271-559b-9054-88db8d041045" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436938 1063 #edb/ref 17592186436934 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436939 1062 #uuid "c4ea5422-7fe4-544c-96ca-1a8f6b528092" 13194139534813 17592186045417 true] [17592186436939 1063 #edb/ref 17592186424228 13194139534813 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-b0b7ba59-d2e5-5c0e-aa1c-0c290b8b930c" 17592186436920 "answer-13a914c9-ac5b-510b-8770-498ebbd342d6" 17592186436921 "answer-17ab80cc-c857-5dfb-9a3a-cfdfd3d6fc0b" 17592186436922 "answer-335bd84d-490e-5a69-979b-a11b772a9908" 17592186436923 "answer-36f39977-9420-5792-a25e-40ed825c033a" 17592186436924 "answer-78e9e533-d5f7-5054-82d6-9d333edf1c19" 17592186436925 "answer-88e03628-9e8e-5879-9ede-a96902f3797a" 17592186436926 "answer-9a07bd93-8453-5012-b970-faf3a1a28f2f" 17592186436927 "an